<Layout title="About Scavland Field Notes" description="About the independent, evidence-led Scavland guide project." canonical="/about/"><section class="listing"><p class="eyebrow">Project note</p><h1 class="page-title">Field<br/><span style="color:var(--acid)">notes.</span></h1><div class="prose"><p>Scavland Field Notes is an independent English guide site built for players who want direct answers and honest evidence boundaries.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Official sources, dated personal tests and authorized community demonstrations are kept distinct. A claim that cannot be reproduced is labelled unverified rather than turned into a confident table.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This site is not affiliated with or endorsed by NoShadow. The name, game and official materials remain the property of their respective owners.</p></div></section></Layout>
